# Sourcecode deployment snapshot: keep source, config, service files, firmware,
# static frontend assets, package manifests, lockfiles, and the RPi/ARM
# bt_frontend/node_modules snapshot required for offline clone-and-run installs.
# Ignore other generated dependency folders, caches, local IDE state, embedded
# Git metadata, and logs.
